    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Embrace the Magic of Demons to Fight Fire with Fire</p></blockquote><p>Most Demon Hunters joined Illidan in Outland as he gathered his forces to battle the Burning Legion. You might have taken a different path, inspired by Illidan rather than trained by him, but the result is the same: you have embraced the magic of the Burning Legion with the single goal of defeating it, on Azeroth and on every other world.</p><h3>Demon Hunter Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.95gEwncHhSRiNvzL]{Spellcasting}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.aun7YvNlOEsdAYxy]{Deft Explorer}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FSe1hKnTHlErX0KE]{Fighting Style}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.s2vvyQICkZ0dMpFI]{Demon Hunter Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.RvdtHH6BB1NKOO9O]{Soul Fragments}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.a0OHj6LRJaDkRBoj]{Spectral Sight}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.qJLnZCr6rFzE8J15]{Torment}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.m5syndsA7TkHGtRC]{Illidari Knowledge}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FLEJIE2kFA6H4nxA]{Soul Shatter}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Co59CSpcxIxBqBkD]{Improved Spectral Sight}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demon Hunter Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Ranger Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.6K9bd7HLoBIKqFR7]{Throw Glaive}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.49v48q9cKkafe4oB]{Sigil of Flame}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.5i0yS0E8ScfxaFBe]{Metamorphosis}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.mRPqk1igeGHFj0Y6]{Chaos Nova}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.9l9wvGNjcFI9kCHq]{Destructive Wave}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
